  "content": "\n\n<h5><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flink.cinderstonestudios.com%252fserverbanner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1198/74/prom_bisect_banner-png.png\" alt=\"使用代码 ELOCIN 购买服务器享 75 折优惠\" width=\"2100\" height=\"366\"></em></a></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/prominence/rpg/banner.png?raw=true\" width=\"895\" height=\"342\"></h5>\n<h5><br><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/prominence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/elocindev/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=查看我的模组！&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" width=\"203\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=1.20&message=Prominence II - FORGE&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"255\" height=\"28\"></strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=支持我&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a></h5>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/nvb-uy/cdn/blob/main/desc/prominence/rpg/1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"一款面向所有人的整合包。Prominence 致力于追求平衡。无论你喜欢战斗、探索、魔法还是科技，这里应有尽有！\" width=\"1123\" height=\"236\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong>功能全面的强力整合包，完美平衡了战斗、探索、魔法与科技，并包含大量自定义内容！为你提供所有值得体验的模组！</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>无论你偏爱战斗、科技、探索还是魔法，都能在这里找到心仪的内容</p>\n<h5>⚔️ <strong>配合 Better Combat 模组带来更出色的战斗机制</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>🌎 惊艳的世界生成与海量可探索建